    bgClass: lighter-gray-bg
    needsLabel: THE NEEDS
    needs:
    - Property & lease tracking
    - Automatic rent invoicing
    - Legal rent indexation
    - Profitability & portfolio tracking
    - Claims & incident management
    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: '<p><strong>Lease tracking & deadlines:</strong> Without a centralized system, lease end dates, revisions and inventories of fixtures get lost in paper files or spreadsheets. A missed one is costly: rent not revised, notice missed.</p><p><strong>Manual rent invoicing:</strong> Generating each rent invoice by hand, month after month, for every property, takes a disproportionate amount of time and leaves room for errors and omissions.</p><p><strong>Rent indexation:</strong> Every lease has its own anniversary date and its own index reference. Calculating and applying indexation manually, property by property, is a recurring source of error.</p><p><strong>Invisible profitability:</strong> Without a unified dashboard, there''s no way to know in real time which properties are actually profitable once charges, loans and unpaid rent are factored in.</p><p><strong>Scattered claims and incidents:</strong> Without centralized tracking, every claim or technical incident is handled case by case, with no history and no link to the tenant or property involved.</p>'
- discriminant: odooExpertise
  value:
    bgClass: white-bg
