    items:
    - logo: cloud-servers-icon
      heading: Properties & buildings
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Create and track properties, grouped by building.</p><ul><li>Configurable document types: energy certificate, lease, inventory of fixtures...</li><li>Map view for properties, buildings, claims and incidents</li></ul>'
    - logo: material-icon
      heading: Leases & rent
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Monthly rent invoices generated automatically.</p><ul><li>Annual rent indexation on the lease anniversary (Belgian health index)</li><li>Electronic lease signature via Odoo Sign</li><li>Lease expiry alert (D-90)</li></ul>'
    - logo: monitoring-icon
      heading: Unpaid rent & deposit
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Automatic reminders in case of non-payment.</p><ul><li>Rental deposit tracking: status, blocked account, refund</li></ul>'
    - logo: network-icon
      heading: Charges & finances
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Dated and recurring charges (property tax prepayment, syndic fund call...).</p><ul><li>Loans with amortization schedule</li><li>Annual charge statement: provisions vs actual charges</li><li>Indexed cadastral income (official coefficients)</li></ul>'
    - logo: python-icon
      heading: Profitability & portfolio
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Rental profitability tracking, gross and net.</p><ul><li>Portfolio dashboard: gross value, debts, net value</li><li>Monthly evolution, per property or per building</li></ul>'
    - logo: offer-icon
